#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Kursus IBM gratis tentang informasi dan komputasi kuantum"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inner products and projections"
msgstr "Perkalian dalam dan proyeksi"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Biggr, operatorname */}\n"
"To better prepare ourselves to explore the capabilities and limitations of quantum circuits, we now introduce some additional mathematical concepts — namely the *inner product* between vectors (and its connection to the Euclidean norm), the notions of *orthogonality* and *orthonormality* for sets of vectors, and *projection* matrices, which will allow us to introduce a handy generalization of standard basis measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Biggr, operatorname */}\n"
"Untuk lebih mempersiapkan diri dalam mengeksplorasi kemampuan dan keterbatasan Circuit kuantum, kita sekarang memperkenalkan beberapa konsep matematis tambahan — yaitu *perkalian dalam* antara vektor (dan hubungannya dengan norma Euclidean), pengertian *ortogonalitas* dan *ortonormalitas* untuk himpunan vektor, serta matriks *proyeksi*, yang akan memungkinkan kita memperkenalkan generalisasi yang berguna dari pengukuran basis standar.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inner products {#inner-products}"
msgstr "Perkalian dalam {#inner-products}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recall that when we use the Dirac notation to refer to an arbitrary column vector as a ket, such as\n"
msgstr "Ingat bahwa ketika kita menggunakan notasi Dirac untuk merujuk pada vektor kolom sembarang sebagai ket, seperti\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "the corresponding bra vector is the *conjugate transpose* of this vector:\n"
msgstr "vektor bra yang sesuai adalah *transpose konjugat* dari vektor ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if we have some classical state set $\\Sigma$ in mind, and we express a column vector as a ket,\n"
"such as\n"
msgstr ""
"Atau, jika kita memiliki himpunan status klasik $\\Sigma$ dalam pikiran, dan kita mengekspresikan vektor kolom sebagai ket,\n"
"seperti\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "then the corresponding row (or bra) vector is the conjugate transpose\n"
msgstr "maka vektor baris (atau bra) yang sesuai adalah transpose konjugat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We also have that the product of a bra vector and a ket vector, viewed as matrices either having a single row or a single column, results in a scalar.\n"
"Specifically, if we have two column vectors\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita juga punya bahwa perkalian dari vektor bra dan vektor ket, dipandang sebagai matriks yang memiliki satu baris atau satu kolom, menghasilkan skalar.\n"
"Secara khusus, jika kita punya dua vektor kolom\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "so that the row vector $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ is as in equation $(1)$, then\n"
msgstr "sehingga vektor baris $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ seperti dalam persamaan $(1)$, maka\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\beta_1 + \\cdots + \\overline{\\alpha_n}\\beta_n.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\beta_1 + \\cdots + \\overline{\\alpha_n}\\beta_n.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively, if we have two column vectors that we have written as\n"
msgstr "Atau, jika kita punya dua vektor kolom yang kita tulis sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "so that $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ is the row vector $(2)$, we find that\n"
msgstr "sehingga $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ adalah vektor baris $(2)$, kita menemukan bahwa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle & = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b\\rangle\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma}\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_b \\langle a \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle & = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b\\rangle\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma}\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_b \\langle a \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where the last equality follows from the observation that $\\langle a \\vert a \\rangle = 1$ and $\\langle a \\vert b \\rangle = 0$ for classical states $a$ and $b$ satisfying $a\\neq b$.\n"
msgstr "di mana kesetaraan terakhir mengikuti dari pengamatan bahwa $\\langle a \\vert a \\rangle = 1$ dan $\\langle a \\vert b \\rangle = 0$ untuk status klasik $a$ dan $b$ yang memenuhi $a\\neq b$.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The value $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle$ is called the *inner product* between the vectors $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ and $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$.\n"
"Inner products are critically important in quantum information and computation;\n"
"we would not get far in understanding quantum information at a mathematical level without them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nilai $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle$ disebut *perkalian dalam* antara vektor $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ dan $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$.\n"
"Perkalian dalam sangat penting dalam informasi dan komputasi kuantum;\n"
"kita tidak akan bisa melangkah jauh dalam memahami informasi kuantum di tingkat matematis tanpanya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us now collect together some basic facts about inner products of vectors.\n"
msgstr "Mari kita kumpulkan beberapa fakta dasar tentang perkalian dalam vektor.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Relationship to the Euclidean norm.** The inner product of any vector\n"
msgstr "**Hubungan dengan norma Euclidean.** Perkalian dalam dari setiap vektor\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   with itself is\n"
msgstr "   dengan dirinya sendiri adalah\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\alpha_a\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert\\alpha_a\\vert^2\n"
"   = \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\alpha_a\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert\\alpha_a\\vert^2\n"
"   = \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Thus, the Euclidean norm of a vector may alternatively be expressed as\n"
msgstr "   Jadi, norma Euclidean dari sebuah vektor bisa dinyatakan secara alternatif sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| = \\sqrt{ \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle }.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| = \\sqrt{ \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle }.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Notice that the Euclidean norm of a vector must always be a nonnegative real number.\n"
"   Moreover, the only way the Euclidean norm of a vector can be equal to zero is if every one of the entries is equal to zero, which is to say that the vector is the zero vector.\n"
msgstr ""
"   Perhatikan bahwa norma Euclidean dari sebuah vektor harus selalu berupa bilangan real tak negatif.\n"
"   Selain itu, satu-satunya cara norma Euclidean sebuah vektor bisa sama dengan nol adalah jika setiap entrinya sama dengan nol, yang berarti vektor tersebut adalah vektor nol.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   We can summarize these observations like this: for every vector $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ we have\n"
msgstr "   Kita bisa merangkum pengamatan-pengamatan ini seperti ini: untuk setiap vektor $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ kita punya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\geq 0,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\geq 0,\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   with $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$ if and only if $\\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$.\n"
"   This property of the inner product is sometimes referred to as _positive definiteness_.\n"
msgstr ""
"   dengan $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$ jika dan hanya jika $\\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$.\n"
"   Sifat perkalian dalam ini kadang-kadang disebut sebagai _definit positif_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Conjugate symmetry.** For any two vectors\n"
msgstr "**Simetri konjugat.** Untuk dua vektor sembarang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   we have\n"
msgstr "   kita punya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\beta_a} \\alpha_a,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\beta_a} \\alpha_a,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   and therefore\n"
msgstr "   dan oleh karena itu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\overline{\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle} = \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\overline{\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle} = \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Linearity in the second argument (and conjugate linearity in the first).**\n"
"Let us suppose that $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$, $\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle$, and $\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle$ are vectors and $\\alpha_1$ and $\\alpha_2$ are complex numbers. If we define a new vector\n"
msgstr ""
"**Linearitas pada argumen kedua (dan linearitas konjugat pada yang pertama).**\n"
"Misalkan $\\vert \\psi \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle,$ dan $\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle$ adalah vektor-vektor dan $\\alpha_1$ serta $\\alpha_2$ adalah bilangan kompleks. Jika kita mendefinisikan vektor baru\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\phi\\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\phi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\phi_2\\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\phi\\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\phi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\phi_2\\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   then\n"
msgstr "   maka\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigl( \\alpha_1\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"   = \\alpha_1 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigl( \\alpha_1\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"   = \\alpha_1 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   That is to say, the inner product is _linear_ in the second argument.\n"
"   This can be verified either through the formulas above or simply by noting that matrix multiplication is linear in each argument (and specifically in the second argument).\n"
msgstr ""
"   Artinya, perkalian dalam bersifat _linear_ pada argumen kedua.\n"
"   Ini bisa diverifikasi baik melalui rumus-rumus di atas maupun dengan mencatat bahwa perkalian matriks bersifat linear pada setiap argumen (dan khususnya pada argumen kedua).\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Combining this fact with conjugate symmetry reveals that the inner product is _conjugate linear_ in the first argument. That is, if $\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle$, $\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle$, and $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ are vectors and $\\alpha_1$ and $\\alpha_2$ are complex numbers, and we define\n"
msgstr "   Menggabungkan fakta ini dengan simetri konjugat mengungkapkan bahwa perkalian dalam bersifat _linear konjugat_ pada argumen pertama. Yaitu, jika $\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,$ dan $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ adalah vektor-vektor dan $\\alpha_1$ serta $\\alpha_2$ adalah bilangan kompleks, dan kita mendefinisikan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   =\n"
"   \\bigl( \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\bigr)\n"
"   \\vert\\phi\\rangle\n"
"   = \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert \\phi \\rangle + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\phi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   =\n"
"   \\bigl( \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\bigr)\n"
"   \\vert\\phi\\rangle\n"
"   = \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert \\phi \\rangle + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\phi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The Cauchy–Schwarz inequality.**\n"
"For every choice of vectors $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ and $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ having the same number of entries, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pertidaksamaan Cauchy–Schwarz.**\n"
"Untuk setiap pilihan vektor $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ dan $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ yang memiliki jumlah entri yang sama, kita punya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\bigr| \\leq \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| \\bigl\\| \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   \\bigr\\|.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\bigr| \\leq \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| \\bigl\\| \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   \\bigr\\|.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   This is an incredibly handy inequality that gets used quite extensively in quantum information (and in many other topics of study).\n"
msgstr "   Ini adalah pertidaksamaan yang sangat berguna yang digunakan cukup ekstensif dalam informasi kuantum (dan dalam banyak topik studi lainnya).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orthogonal and orthonormal sets {#orthogonal-and-orthonormal-sets}"
msgstr "Himpunan ortogonal dan ortonormal {#orthogonal-and-orthonormal-sets}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two vectors $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ and $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ are said to be *orthogonal* if their inner product is zero:\n"
msgstr "Dua vektor $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ dan $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ dikatakan *ortogonal* jika perkalian dalamnya adalah nol:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = 0.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = 0.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Geometrically, we can think about orthogonal vectors as vectors at right angles to each other.\n"
msgstr "Secara geometris, kita bisa memikirkan vektor ortogonal sebagai vektor yang saling tegak lurus.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A set of vectors $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is called an *orthogonal set* if every vector in the set is orthogonal to every other vector in the set.\n"
"That is, this set is orthogonal if\n"
msgstr ""
"Himpunan vektor $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ disebut *himpunan ortogonal* jika setiap vektor dalam himpunan ortogonal terhadap setiap vektor lain dalam himpunan.\n"
"Artinya, himpunan ini ortogonal jika\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle = 0\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle = 0\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for all choices of $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$ for which $j\\neq k$.\n"
msgstr "untuk semua pilihan $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$ yang memenuhi $j\\neq k$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A set of vectors $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is called an *orthonormal* set if it is an orthogonal set and, in addition, every vector in the set is a unit vector.\n"
"Alternatively, this set is an orthonormal set if we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Himpunan vektor $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ disebut himpunan *ortonormal* jika merupakan himpunan ortogonal dan, selain itu, setiap vektor dalam himpunan adalah vektor satuan.\n"
"Atau, himpunan ini adalah himpunan ortonormal jika kita punya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & j = k\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & j\\neq k\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\tag{3}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & j = k\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & j\\neq k\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\tag{3}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for all choices of $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$.\n"
msgstr "untuk semua pilihan $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, a set $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is an *orthonormal basis* if, in addition to being an orthonormal set, it forms a basis.\n"
"This is equivalent to $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ being an orthonormal set and $m$ being equal to the dimension of the space from which $\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ are drawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya, himpunan $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ adalah *basis ortonormal* jika, selain menjadi himpunan ortonormal, ia membentuk basis.\n"
"Ini setara dengan $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ sebagai himpunan ortonormal dan $m$ sama dengan dimensi ruang dari mana $\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ diambil.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example, for any classical state set $\\Sigma$, the set of all standard basis vectors\n"
msgstr "Misalnya, untuk himpunan status klasik $\\Sigma$ apapun, himpunan semua vektor basis standar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\big\\{ \\vert a \\rangle \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\big\\{ \\vert a \\rangle \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is an orthonormal basis.\n"
"The set $\\{\\vert+\\rangle,\\vert-\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal basis for the $2$-dimensional space corresponding to a single qubit, and the Bell basis $\\{\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\phi^-\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal basis for the $4$-dimensional space corresponding to two qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"adalah basis ortonormal.\n"
"Himpunan $\\{\\vert+\\rangle,\\vert-\\rangle\\}$ adalah basis ortonormal untuk ruang $2$-dimensi yang sesuai dengan qubit tunggal, dan basis Bell $\\{\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\phi^-\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\}$ adalah basis ortonormal untuk ruang $4$-dimensi yang sesuai dengan dua qubit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extending orthonormal sets to orthonormal bases {#extending-orthonormal-sets-to-orthonormal-bases}"
msgstr "Memperluas himpunan ortonormal menjadi basis ortonormal {#extending-orthonormal-sets-to-orthonormal-bases}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Suppose that $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ are vectors that live in an $n$-dimensional space, and assume moreover that $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal set.\n"
"Orthonormal sets are always linearly independent sets, so these vectors necessarily span a subspace of dimension $m$.\n"
"From this we conclude that $m\\leq n$ because the dimension of the subspace spanned by these vectors cannot be larger than the dimension of the entire space from which they're drawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"Misalkan $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ adalah vektor-vektor yang berada dalam ruang $n$-dimensi, dan asumsikan bahwa $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ adalah himpunan ortonormal.\n"
"Himpunan ortonormal selalu merupakan himpunan yang bebas linear, jadi vektor-vektor ini harus merentang subruang berdimensi $m$.\n"
"Dari sini kita menyimpulkan bahwa $m\\leq n$ karena dimensi subruang yang direntang oleh vektor-vektor ini tidak bisa lebih besar dari dimensi seluruh ruang dari mana mereka diambil.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If it is the case that $m<n$, then it is always possible to choose an additional $n-m$ vectors\n"
"$\\vert \\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ so that\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ forms an orthonormal basis.\n"
"A procedure known as the *Gram–Schmidt orthogonalization process* can be used to construct these vectors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika ternyata $m<n$, maka selalu mungkin untuk memilih tambahan $n-m$ vektor\n"
"$\\vert \\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ sehingga\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ membentuk basis ortonormal.\n"
"Prosedur yang dikenal sebagai *proses ortogonalisasi Gram–Schmidt* bisa digunakan untuk mengonstruksi vektor-vektor ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orthonormal sets and unitary matrices {#orthonormal-sets-and-unitary-matrices}"
msgstr "Himpunan ortonormal dan matriks uniter {#orthonormal-sets-and-unitary-matrices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orthonormal sets of vectors are closely connected with unitary matrices.\n"
"One way to express this connection is to say that the following three statements are logically equivalent (meaning that they are all true or all false) for any choice of a square matrix $U$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Himpunan ortonormal vektor erat kaitannya dengan matriks uniter.\n"
"Salah satu cara untuk mengekspresikan hubungan ini adalah dengan mengatakan bahwa tiga pernyataan berikut secara logis setara (artinya semuanya benar atau semuanya salah) untuk pilihan matriks persegi $U$ apapun:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The matrix $U$ is unitary (that is, $U^{\\dagger} U = \\mathbb{I} = U U^{\\dagger}$).\n"
msgstr "Matriks $U$ bersifat uniter (yaitu, $U^{\\dagger} U = \\mathbb{I} = U U^{\\dagger}$).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The rows of $U$ form an orthonormal set.\n"
msgstr "Baris-baris $U$ membentuk himpunan ortonormal.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The columns of $U$ form an orthonormal set.\n"
msgstr "Kolom-kolom $U$ membentuk himpunan ortonormal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This equivalence is actually pretty straightforward when we think about how matrix multiplication and the conjugate transpose work.\n"
"Suppose, for instance, that we have a $3\\times 3$ matrix like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kesetaraan ini sebenarnya cukup langsung ketika kita memikirkan bagaimana perkalian matriks dan transpose konjugat bekerja.\n"
"Misalkan, contohnya, kita punya matriks $3\\times 3$ seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The conjugate transpose of $U$ looks like this:\n"
msgstr "Transpose konjugat dari $U$ terlihat seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Multiplying the two matrices, with the conjugate transpose on the left-hand side, gives us this matrix:\n"
msgstr "Mengalikan dua matriks, dengan transpose konjugat di sisi kiri, memberi kita matriks ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"&\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[4mm]\n"
"\\quad &=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"&\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[4mm]\n"
"\\quad &=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If we form three vectors from the columns of $U$,\n"
msgstr "Jika kita membentuk tiga vektor dari kolom-kolom $U$,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_2\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,2}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_3\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_2\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,2}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_3\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "then we can alternatively express the product above as follows:\n"
msgstr "maka kita bisa mengekspresikan perkalian di atas secara alternatif sebagai berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Referring to the equation $(3)$, we now see that the condition that this matrix is equal to the identity matrix is equivalent to the orthonormality of the set $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_3\\rangle\\}$.\n"
msgstr "Merujuk pada persamaan $(3)$, kita sekarang melihat bahwa kondisi bahwa matriks ini sama dengan matriks identitas setara dengan ortonormalitas himpunan $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_3\\rangle\\}$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This argument generalizes to unitary matrices of any size.\n"
"The fact that the rows of a matrix form an orthonormal basis if and only if the matrix is unitary then follows from the fact that a matrix is unitary if and only if its transpose is unitary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Argumen ini berlaku umum untuk matriks uniter berukuran apapun.\n"
"Fakta bahwa baris-baris sebuah matriks membentuk basis ortonormal jika dan hanya jika matriks tersebut bersifat uniter kemudian mengikuti dari fakta bahwa sebuah matriks bersifat uniter jika dan hanya jika transposenya bersifat uniter.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given the equivalence described above, together with the fact that every orthonormal set can be extended to form an orthonormal basis, we conclude the following useful fact:\n"
"Given any orthonormal set of vectors $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ drawn from an $n$-dimensional space, there exists a unitary matrix $U$ whose first $m$ columns are the vectors $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$.\n"
"Pictorially, we can always find a unitary matrix having this form:\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengingat kesetaraan yang dijelaskan di atas, bersama dengan fakta bahwa setiap himpunan ortonormal bisa diperluas untuk membentuk basis ortonormal, kita menyimpulkan fakta berguna berikut:\n"
"Diberikan himpunan ortonormal vektor $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ yang diambil dari ruang $n$-dimensi, terdapat matriks uniter $U$ yang $m$ kolom pertamanya adalah vektor $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$.\n"
"Secara bergambar, kita selalu bisa menemukan matriks uniter dengan bentuk ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\left(\n"
"  \\begin{array}{ccccccc}\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\\\\\n"
"    \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle & \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_m\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle &\n"
"    \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\left(\n"
"  \\begin{array}{ccccccc}\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\\\\\n"
"    \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle & \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_m\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle &\n"
"    \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, the last $n-m$ columns are filled in with any choice of vectors $\\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ that make\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ an orthonormal basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, $n-m$ kolom terakhir diisi dengan pilihan vektor $\\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ apapun yang membuat\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ menjadi basis ortonormal.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Projections and projective measurements {#projections-and-projective-measurements}"
msgstr "Proyeksi dan pengukuran proyektif {#projections-and-projective-measurements}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Projection matrices {#projection-matrices}"
msgstr "Matriks proyeksi {#projection-matrices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A square matrix $\\Pi$ is called a *projection* if it satisfies two properties:\n"
msgstr "Matriks persegi $\\Pi$ disebut *proyeksi* jika memenuhi dua sifat:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '  1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\Pi = \\Pi^{\\dagger}$.\n"
msgstr "$\\Pi = \\Pi^{\\dagger}$.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '  2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\Pi^2 = \\Pi$.\n"
msgstr "$\\Pi^2 = \\Pi$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Matrices that satisfy the first condition — that they are equal to their own conjugate transpose — are called *Hermitian matrices*, and matrices that satisfy the second condition — that squaring them leaves them unchanged — are called *idempotent* matrices.\n"
msgstr "Matriks yang memenuhi kondisi pertama — bahwa mereka sama dengan transpose konjugatnya sendiri — disebut *matriks Hermitian*, dan matriks yang memenuhi kondisi kedua — bahwa mengkuadratkannya tidak mengubahnya — disebut matriks *idempoten*.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a word of caution, the word *projection* is sometimes used to refer to any matrix that satisfies just the second condition but not necessarily the first, and when this is done the term *orthogonal projection* is typically used to refer to matrices satisfying both properties.\n"
"In the context of quantum information and computation, however, the terms *projection* and *projection matrix* more typically refer to matrices satisfying both conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai peringatan, kata *proyeksi* kadang-kadang digunakan untuk merujuk pada matriks apapun yang memenuhi hanya kondisi kedua tapi tidak harus yang pertama, dan ketika ini dilakukan istilah *proyeksi ortogonal* biasanya digunakan untuk merujuk pada matriks yang memenuhi kedua kondisi.\n"
"Namun dalam konteks informasi dan komputasi kuantum, istilah *proyeksi* dan *matriks proyeksi* lebih sering merujuk pada matriks yang memenuhi kedua kondisi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An example of a projection is the matrix\n"
msgstr "Contoh proyeksi adalah matriks\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\n"
"\\tag{4}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\n"
"\\tag{4}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for any unit vector $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$.\n"
"We can see that this matrix is Hermitian as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"untuk vektor satuan $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ apapun.\n"
"Kita bisa melihat bahwa matriks ini bersifat Hermitian sebagai berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger} = \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\bigl( \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger} = \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\bigl( \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, to obtain the second equality, we have used the formula\n"
msgstr "Di sini, untuk mendapatkan kesetaraan kedua, kita telah menggunakan rumus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(A B)^{\\dagger} = B^{\\dagger} A^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(A B)^{\\dagger} = B^{\\dagger} A^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "which is always true, for any two matrices $A$ and $B$ for which the product $AB$ makes sense.\n"
msgstr "yang selalu benar, untuk dua matriks $A$ dan $B$ apapun yang perkalian $AB$-nya masuk akal.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To see that the matrix $\\Pi$ in $(4)$ is idempotent, we can use the assumption that $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is a unit vector, so that it satisfies $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi\\rangle = 1$.\n"
"Thus, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk melihat bahwa matriks $\\Pi$ dalam $(4)$ bersifat idempoten, kita bisa menggunakan asumsi bahwa $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ adalah vektor satuan, sehingga memenuhi $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi\\rangle = 1$.\n"
"Jadi, kita punya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"= \\bigl( \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert \\bigr)^2\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"= \\bigl( \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert \\bigr)^2\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "More generally, if $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is any orthonormal set of vectors, then the matrix\n"
msgstr "Lebih umum, jika $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ adalah himpunan ortonormal vektor apapun, maka matriks\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{5}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{5}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is a projection.\n"
"Specifically, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"adalah proyeksi.\n"
"Secara khusus, kita punya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger}\n"
"&= \\biggl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\bigl(\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\\bigr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"&= \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger}\n"
"&= \\biggl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\bigl(\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\\bigr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"&= \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "and\n"
msgstr "dan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"& = \\biggl( \\sum_{j = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{j = 1}^m\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert  \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"& = \\biggl( \\sum_{j = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{j = 1}^m\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert  \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where the orthonormality of $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ implies the second-to-last equality.\n"
msgstr "di mana ortonormalitas $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ menyiratkan kesetaraan kedua dari terakhir.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In fact, this exhausts all of the possibilities: *every* projection $\\Pi$ can be written in the form $(5)$ for some choice of an orthonormal set $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$.\n"
"(Technically speaking, the zero matrix $\\Pi=0$, which is a projection, is a special case.\n"
"To fit it into the general form $(5)$ we must allow the possibility that the sum is empty, resulting in the zero matrix.)\n"
msgstr ""
"Faktanya, ini menghabiskan semua kemungkinan: *setiap* proyeksi $\\Pi$ bisa ditulis dalam bentuk $(5)$ untuk beberapa pilihan himpunan ortonormal $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}$.\n"
"(Secara teknis, matriks nol $\\Pi=0$, yang merupakan proyeksi, adalah kasus khusus.\n"
"Untuk memasukkannya ke dalam bentuk umum $(5)$ kita harus mengizinkan kemungkinan bahwa jumlahnya kosong, menghasilkan matriks nol.)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Projective measurements {#projective-measurements}"
msgstr "Pengukuran proyektif {#projective-measurements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The notion of a measurement of a quantum system is more general than just standard basis measurements.\n"
"*Projective measurements* are measurements that are described by a collection of projections whose sum is equal to the identity matrix.\n"
"In symbols, a collection $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ of projection matrices describes a projective measurement if\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengertian pengukuran sistem kuantum lebih umum daripada sekadar pengukuran basis standar.\n"
"*Pengukuran proyektif* adalah pengukuran yang dijelaskan oleh kumpulan proyeksi yang jumlahnya sama dengan matriks identitas.\n"
"Dalam simbol, kumpulan $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ dari matriks proyeksi mendeskripsikan pengukuran proyektif jika\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 + \\cdots + \\Pi_{m-1} = \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 + \\cdots + \\Pi_{m-1} = \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When such a measurement is performed on a system $\\mathsf{X}$ while it is in some state $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$, two things happen:\n"
msgstr "Ketika pengukuran seperti itu dilakukan pada sistem $\\mathsf{X}$ saat berada dalam keadaan $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$, dua hal terjadi:\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each $k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$, the outcome of the measurement is $k$ with probability equal to\n"
msgstr "Untuk setiap $k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$, hasil pengukuran adalah $k$ dengan probabilitas sama dengan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $k$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $k$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For whichever outcome $k$ the measurement produces, the state of $\\mathsf{X}$ becomes\n"
msgstr "Untuk hasil $k$ apapun yang dihasilkan pengukuran, keadaan $\\mathsf{X}$ menjadi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can also choose outcomes other than $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ for projective measurements if we wish.\n"
"More generally, for any finite and nonempty set $\\Sigma$, if we have a collection of projection matrices\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita juga bisa memilih hasil selain $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ untuk pengukuran proyektif jika kita mau.\n"
"Lebih umum, untuk himpunan $\\Sigma$ yang berhingga dan tidak kosong apapun, jika kita punya kumpulan matriks proyeksi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\{\\Pi_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\{\\Pi_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "that satisfies the condition\n"
msgstr "yang memenuhi kondisi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\Pi_a = \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\Pi_a = \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "then this collection describes a projective measurement whose possible outcomes coincide with the set $\\Sigma$, where the rules are the same as before:\n"
msgstr "maka kumpulan ini mendeskripsikan pengukuran proyektif yang kemungkinan hasilnya bertepatan dengan himpunan $\\Sigma$, di mana aturannya sama seperti sebelumnya:\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each $a\\in\\Sigma$, the outcome of the measurement is $a$ with probability equal to\n"
msgstr "Untuk setiap $a\\in\\Sigma$, hasil pengukuran adalah $a$ dengan probabilitas sama dengan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $a$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $a$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For whichever outcome $a$ the measurement produces, the state of $\\mathsf{X}$ becomes\n"
msgstr "Untuk hasil $a$ apapun yang dihasilkan pengukuran, keadaan $\\mathsf{X}$ menjadi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, standard basis measurements are equivalent to projective measurements, where $\\Sigma$ is the set of classical states of whatever system $\\mathsf{X}$ we're talking about and our set of projection matrices is\n"
"$\\{\\vert a\\rangle\\langle a\\vert:a\\in\\Sigma\\}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Misalnya, pengukuran basis standar setara dengan pengukuran proyektif, di mana $\\Sigma$ adalah himpunan status klasik dari sistem $\\mathsf{X}$ apapun yang kita bicarakan dan himpunan matriks proyeksi kita adalah\n"
"$\\{\\vert a\\rangle\\langle a\\vert:a\\in\\Sigma\\}$.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another example of a projective measurement, this time on two qubits $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$, is given by the set\n"
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$, where\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh lain dari pengukuran proyektif, kali ini pada dua qubit $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$, diberikan oleh himpunan\n"
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$, di mana\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle\\langle \\phi^+ \\vert + \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle\\langle \\phi^- \\vert + \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle\\langle \\psi^+ \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\langle\\psi^-\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle\\langle \\phi^+ \\vert + \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle\\langle \\phi^- \\vert + \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle\\langle \\psi^+ \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\langle\\psi^-\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If we have multiple systems that are jointly in some quantum state and a projective measurement is performed on just one of the systems, the action is similar to what we had for standard basis measurements — and in fact we can now describe this action in much simpler terms than we could before.\n"
msgstr "Jika kita punya beberapa sistem yang secara bersama berada dalam keadaan kuantum tertentu dan pengukuran proyektif dilakukan pada hanya satu sistem, aksinya mirip dengan yang kita miliki untuk pengukuran basis standar — dan faktanya kita sekarang bisa mendeskripsikan aksi ini dalam istilah yang jauh lebih sederhana dari sebelumnya.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To be precise, let us suppose that we have two systems $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ in a quantum state $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$, and a projective measurement described by a collection $\\{\\Pi_a : a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ is performed on the system $\\mathsf{X}$, while nothing is done to $\\mathsf{Y}$.\n"
"Doing this is then equivalent to performing the projective measurement described by the collection\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk lebih tepatnya, misalkan kita punya dua sistem $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ dalam keadaan kuantum $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$, dan pengukuran proyektif yang dijelaskan oleh kumpulan $\\{\\Pi_a : a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ dilakukan pada sistem $\\mathsf{X}$, sementara tidak ada yang dilakukan pada $\\mathsf{Y}$.\n"
"Melakukan ini kemudian setara dengan melakukan pengukuran proyektif yang dijelaskan oleh kumpulan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\{ \\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I} \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\{ \\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I} \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"on the joint system $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$.\n"
"Each measurement outcome $a$ results with probability\n"
msgstr ""
"pada sistem bersama $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$.\n"
"Setiap hasil pengukuran $a$ muncul dengan probabilitas\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "and conditioned on the result $a$ appearing, the state of the joint system $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ becomes\n"
msgstr "dan dengan kondisi hasil $a$ yang muncul, keadaan sistem bersama $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ menjadi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{(\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{(\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementing projective measurements {#implementing-projective-measurements}"
msgstr "Mengimplementasikan pengukuran proyektif {#implementing-projective-measurements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arbitrary projective measurements can be implemented using unitary operations, standard basis measurements, and an extra workspace system, as will now be explained.\n"
msgstr "Pengukuran proyektif sembarang bisa diimplementasikan menggunakan operasi uniter, pengukuran basis standar, dan sistem ruang kerja tambahan, seperti yang akan dijelaskan sekarang.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us suppose that $\\mathsf{X}$ is a system and $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ is a projective measurement on $\\mathsf{X}$. We can easily generalize this discussion to projective measurements having different sets of outcomes, but in the interest of convenience and simplicity we will assume the set of possible outcomes for our measurement is $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$.\n"
msgstr "Misalkan $\\mathsf{X}$ adalah sistem dan $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ adalah pengukuran proyektif pada $\\mathsf{X}$. Kita bisa dengan mudah menggeneralisasi diskusi ini untuk pengukuran proyektif dengan himpunan hasil yang berbeda, tapi demi kemudahan dan kesederhanaan kita akan mengasumsikan himpunan kemungkinan hasil untuk pengukuran kita adalah $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us note explicitly that $m$ is not necessarily equal to the number of classical states of $\\mathsf{X}$ — we'll let $n$ be the number of classical states of $\\mathsf{X}$, which means that each matrix $\\Pi_k$ is an $n\\times n$ projection matrix.\n"
msgstr "Mari kita catat secara eksplisit bahwa $m$ tidak harus sama dengan jumlah status klasik dari $\\mathsf{X}$ — kita akan membiarkan $n$ sebagai jumlah status klasik dari $\\mathsf{X}$, yang berarti setiap matriks $\\Pi_k$ adalah matriks proyeksi $n\\times n$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because we assume that $\\{\\Pi_0\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ represents a projective measurement, it is necessarily the case that\n"
msgstr "Karena kita mengasumsikan bahwa $\\{\\Pi_0\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ merepresentasikan pengukuran proyektif, harus berlaku bahwa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\Pi_k = \\mathbb{I}_n.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\Pi_k = \\mathbb{I}_n.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our goal is to perform a process that has the same effect as performing this projective measurement on $\\mathsf{X}$, but to do this using only unitary operations and standard basis measurements.\n"
msgstr "Tujuan kita adalah melakukan proses yang memiliki efek yang sama seperti melakukan pengukuran proyektif ini pada $\\mathsf{X}$, tapi melakukannya hanya menggunakan operasi uniter dan pengukuran basis standar.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will make use of an extra workspace system $\\mathsf{Y}$ to do this, and specifically we'll take the classical state set of $\\mathsf{Y}$ to be $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$, which is the same as the set of outcomes of the projective measurement.\n"
"The idea is that we will perform a standard basis measurement on $\\mathsf{Y}$, and interpret the outcome of this measurement as being equivalent to the outcome of the projective measurement on $\\mathsf{X}$.\n"
"We'll need to assume that $\\mathsf{Y}$ is initialized to some fixed state, which we'll choose to be $\\vert 0\\rangle$.\n"
"(Any other choice of fixed quantum state vector could be made to work, but choosing $\\vert 0\\rangle$ makes the explanation to follow much simpler.)\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menggunakan sistem ruang kerja tambahan $\\mathsf{Y}$ untuk melakukan ini, dan secara khusus kita akan mengambil himpunan status klasik dari $\\mathsf{Y}$ sebagai $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$, yang sama dengan himpunan hasil pengukuran proyektif.\n"
"Idenya adalah bahwa kita akan melakukan pengukuran basis standar pada $\\mathsf{Y}$, dan menginterpretasikan hasil pengukuran ini sebagai setara dengan hasil pengukuran proyektif pada $\\mathsf{X}$.\n"
"Kita perlu mengasumsikan bahwa $\\mathsf{Y}$ diinisialisasi ke keadaan tetap, yang akan kita pilih sebagai $\\vert 0\\rangle$.\n"
"(Pilihan keadaan vektor kuantum tetap lainnya bisa dibuat berhasil, tapi memilih $\\vert 0\\rangle$ membuat penjelasan berikut jauh lebih sederhana.)\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Of course, in order for a standard basis measurement of $\\mathsf{Y}$ to tell us anything about $\\mathsf{X}$, we will need to allow $\\mathsf{X}$ and $\\mathsf{Y}$ to interact somehow before measuring $\\mathsf{Y}$, by performing a unitary operation on the system $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$.\n"
"First consider this matrix:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tentu saja, agar pengukuran basis standar dari $\\mathsf{Y}$ bisa memberi tahu kita sesuatu tentang $\\mathsf{X}$, kita perlu membiarkan $\\mathsf{X}$ dan $\\mathsf{Y}$ berinteraksi entah bagaimana sebelum mengukur $\\mathsf{Y}$, dengan melakukan operasi uniter pada sistem $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$.\n"
"Pertama pertimbangkan matriks ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\Pi_k.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\Pi_k.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expressed explicitly as a so-called *block matrix*, which is essentially a matrix of matrices that we interpret as a single, larger matrix, $M$ looks like this:\n"
msgstr "Diekspresikan secara eksplisit sebagai *matriks blok*, yang pada dasarnya adalah matriks dari matriks yang kita interpretasikan sebagai satu matriks yang lebih besar, $M$ terlihat seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & 0 & \\cdots & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & 0 & \\cdots & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, each $0$ represents an $n\\times n$ matrix filled entirely with zeros, so that the entire matrix $M$ is an $nm\\times nm$ matrix.\n"
msgstr "Di sini, setiap $0$ merepresentasikan matriks $n\\times n$ yang sepenuhnya terisi dengan nol, sehingga seluruh matriks $M$ adalah matriks $nm\\times nm.$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, $M$ is certainly not a unitary matrix (unless $m=1$, in which case $\\Pi_0 = \\mathbb{I}$, giving $M = \\mathbb{I}$ in this trivial case) because unitary matrices cannot have any columns (or rows) that are entirely $0$; unitary matrices have columns that form orthonormal bases, and the all-zero vector is not a unit vector.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang, $M$ jelas bukan matriks uniter (kecuali $m=1,$ dalam hal ini $\\Pi_0 = \\mathbb{I},$ memberikan $M = \\mathbb{I}$ dalam kasus trivial ini) karena matriks uniter tidak bisa memiliki kolom (atau baris) yang sepenuhnya $0;$ matriks uniter memiliki kolom yang membentuk basis ortonormal, dan vektor nol bukan vektor satuan.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"However, it is the case that the first $n$ columns of $M$ are orthonormal, and we get this from the assumption that $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ is a measurement.\n"
"To verify this claim, notice that for each $j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$, the vector formed by column number $j$ of $M$ is as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Namun, memang benar bahwa $n$ kolom pertama dari $M$ bersifat ortonormal, dan ini kita dapatkan dari asumsi bahwa $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ adalah pengukuran.\n"
"Untuk memverifikasi klaim ini, perhatikan bahwa untuk setiap $j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$, vektor yang dibentuk oleh kolom nomor $j$ dari $M$ adalah sebagai berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle = M \\vert 0, j\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle = M \\vert 0, j\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that here we're numbering the columns starting from column $0$. Taking the inner product of column $i$ with column $j$ when $i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ gives\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahwa di sini kita menomori kolom mulai dari kolom $0$. Mengambil perkalian dalam dari kolom $i$ dengan kolom $j$ ketika $i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ memberikan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_i \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"& =\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert i\\rangle\\biggr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1} \\vert l \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle k \\vert l \\rangle \\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\langle i \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert j \\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & i = j\\\\\n"
"0 & i\\neq j,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_i \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"& =\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert i\\rangle\\biggr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1} \\vert l \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle k \\vert l \\rangle \\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\langle i \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert j \\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & i = j\\\\\n"
"0 & i\\neq j,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "which is what we needed to show.\n"
msgstr "yang merupakan yang perlu kita tunjukkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, because the first $n$ columns of the matrix $M$ are orthonormal, we can replace all of the remaining zero entries by some different choice of complex number entries so that the entire matrix is unitary.\n"
msgstr "Jadi, karena $n$ kolom pertama dari matriks $M$ bersifat ortonormal, kita bisa mengganti semua entri nol yang tersisa dengan pilihan entri bilangan kompleks yang berbeda sehingga seluruh matriks bersifat uniter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If we're given the matrices $\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}$, we can compute suitable matrices to fill in for the blocks marked $\\fbox{?}$ in the equation — using the Gram–Schmidt process — but it does not matter specifically what these matrices are for the sake of this discussion.\n"
msgstr "Jika kita diberikan matriks $\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}$, kita bisa menghitung matriks yang sesuai untuk mengisi blok yang ditandai $\\fbox{?}$ dalam persamaan — menggunakan proses Gram–Schmidt — tapi tidak penting secara khusus apa matriks-matriks ini untuk tujuan diskusi ini.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally we can describe the measurement process: we first perform $U$ on the joint system $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ and then measure $\\mathsf{Y}$ with respect to a standard basis measurement.\n"
"For an arbitrary state $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ of $\\mathsf{X}$, we obtain the state\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya kita bisa mendeskripsikan proses pengukuran: kita pertama melakukan $U$ pada sistem bersama $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ dan kemudian mengukur $\\mathsf{Y}$ terhadap pengukuran basis standar.\n"
"Untuk keadaan sembarang $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ dari $\\mathsf{X}$, kita mendapatkan keadaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= M \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert\\phi\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= M \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert\\phi\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the first equality follows from the fact that $U$ and $M$ agree on their first $n$ columns.\n"
"When we perform a projective measurement on $\\mathsf{Y}$, we obtain each outcome $k$ with probability\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana kesamaan pertama mengikuti dari fakta bahwa $U$ dan $M$ sama pada $n$ kolom pertamanya.\n"
"Ketika kita melakukan pengukuran proyektif pada $\\mathsf{Y}$, kita mendapatkan setiap hasil $k$ dengan probabilitas\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "in which case the state of $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ becomes\n"
msgstr "dalam hal ini keadaan $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ menjadi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, $\\mathsf{Y}$ stores a copy of the measurement outcome and $\\mathsf{X}$ changes precisely as it would had the projective measurement described by $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ been performed directly on $\\mathsf{X}$.\n"
msgstr "Jadi, $\\mathsf{Y}$ menyimpan salinan hasil pengukuran dan $\\mathsf{X}$ berubah tepat seperti yang terjadi jika pengukuran proyektif yang dijelaskan oleh $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ dilakukan langsung pada $\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
